        "id": "cv-sr-q-p",
        "type": "text-block",
        "settings": {
         "content": "<p>Each canvas in Tideline was begun on the quay and abandoned at the moment the light changed — then carried back to the studio and argued with for months. What's left is less a view than a memory of standing there.</p>",
